OL,3,APiddington to bring legal challenge
OL,4,Aover asylum base plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpponents have six weeks to challenge
OL,7,Fthe decision. Parish council chairman
OL,8,FTim McNally said ministers should
OL,9,F"absolutely" be ready for a legal
OL,10,Fchallenge.
OL,12,FDefence minister Luke Pollard said the
OL,13,Fgovernment would continue to engage
OL,14,Fwith the community.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
