OL,3,AEx-Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang summoned to
OL,4,Atestify before Congress about affair
OL,5,Awith alleged Chinese spy
OL,6,
OL,7,FFormer Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang has been
OL,8,Fsummoned to testify next month before a
OL,9,FSenate committee about his alleged
OL,10,Faffair with a woman suspected of being
OL,11,Fa Chinese spy.
OL,13,FHuang abruptly quit on Thursday as head
OL,14,Fof one of the world's most valuable
OL,15,Fcompanies after revelations of alleged
OL,16,Fextramarital affairs, in a stunning
OL,17,Ffall from grace that sent shockwaves
OL,18,Fthrough Silicon Valley.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
