OL,3,AZelensky welcomes US bringing Europe
OL,4,Ainto Russia-Ukraine peace talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine's president has welcomed a
OL,7,Fpledge from US envoys, Jared Kushner
OL,8,Fand Steve Witkoff, to include delegates
OL,9,Ffrom the European Union in the next
OL,10,Fround of peace talks with Russia.
OL,12,FEuropean leaders have expressed
OL,13,Fdeepening security concerns this week,
OL,14,Fand Volodymyr Zelensky said bringing
OL,15,Fthem into the talks would ensure the EU
OL,16,Fhas a "voice" in negotiations.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
